usage: serve.py [-h] [--profile {mtp-singleton-v1,mtp-serving-v1}]
                [--default-reasoning-effort {none,low,high,xhigh,max}]
                [--host HOST] [--port PORT] [--print-config] [--no-validate]

Launch ds41f local text runtime

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --profile {mtp-singleton-v1,mtp-serving-v1}
  --default-reasoning-effort {none,low,high,xhigh,max}
                        reasoning effort for requests without reasoning
                        controls
  --host HOST           override DS41F_HOST
  --port PORT           override DS41F_PORT
  --print-config        print resolved config/provenance and exit
  --no-validate         skip path validation before launch
